[b]Malformed input is handled gracefully.[/b]

An unclosed tag: [i]this italic never closes.

A stray closing tag: [/u] on its own.

Overlapping tags: [b]bold [i]both[/b] italic[/i].

An unknown tag: [wibble]stays exactly as written[/wibble].

A list item outside a list: [*]lonely.

Brackets that are not tags: see [1], [2] and [ 3 ].

[code]
Inside a code block nothing is parsed: [b]not bold[/b] and [/i] is fine.
[/code]
